{
  "comment": "Reference vectors from W3C CSS Color 4 worked examples (https://www.w3.org/TR/css-color-4/). Tolerance notes: hue channels get 0.25 deg in the harness (spec prints hue to 0.1 deg/integers); cases whose oklch source is printed to 2-3 decimals use 0.005 to absorb round-trip print error. Skipped on purpose: (1) Lab/LCH vectors - CSS lab()/lch() are D50-based, colorcpp cielab_t is D65; (2) out-of-gamut targets - colorcpp from_unit clamps unit space on cast; (3) xyz-d65(1,1,1)->lab - reference L=100.1154 exceeds the lab_l channel max.",
